WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:18.201
At nine p.m., Danny goes to bed.

2
00:00:18.202 --> 00:00:28.273
At ten p.m., Danny starts to dream.

3
00:00:28.274 --> 00:00:38.219
At eleven p.m., Peter comes to play.

4
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:48.241
Danny and Peter go flying at midnight.

5
00:00:48.242 --> 00:00:58.216
At one a.m., they fly over the city.

6
00:00:58.217 --> 00:01:06.222
At two a.m., they fly over the ocean.

7
00:01:06.223 --> 00:01:18.215
At three a.m., they return home.

8
00:01:18.216 --> 00:01:23.456
Peter says good-bye.

9
00:01:23.457 --> 00:01:30.096
Danny goes back to bed.

10
00:01:30.097 --> 00:01:39.949
At seven a.m., Danny wakes up.

11
00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:50.385
Was it all a dream?
